From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fonts: gate lazy @font-face fetches by weight, style,
 visibility, and fallback coverage
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

flush_needed_font_faces previously fetched every weight, slant, and fallback
family declared in any computed font-family list, including faces inside
display:none subtrees. Pages with multi-weight families or CJK fallback
chains downloaded tens of megabytes of unused fonts and stalled rendering.

Walk the visible flat tree, match each pending face against visible text's
computed (style, weight) using CSS Fonts 4 §5.2 selection with exact weight
ranges, and defer fallback web-font families until earlier families in the
stack either fail or lack a glyph in the element's text.
